<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A macro that gets rid of recoil for the Vector in Rainbow Six Siege.



Aspect ratio: 4:3 (ingame setting for aspect ratio)

Resolution: 1920x1080



Attachments: HOLO A, Compensator, Vertical Grip, Laser



FOV 90

Sensitivity 19

DPI 1250

1x Sensitivity 55

2.5x Sensitivity 35



Instructions:

Set a macro enable and disable button
Set this macro as the one you want to use on your left mouse button

Set it to run while holding

Enable when you in the round and disable when you aren't</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 1 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 3 ms
Delay 6 ms
Delay 9 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
